## RelationType: Placed By

Connects each order to the customer that placed it.

### Endpoint

| Source | Target | Type |
| --- | --- | --- |
| order | customer | direct |

### Mapping Rules

| Source Property | Target Property |
| --- | --- |
| customer_id | customer_id |
